Mary has 2 potted plants on each of the 40 window ledges, so she has 2 * 40 = 80 potted plants. She received 18 new potted plants, so she now has 80 + 18 = 98 potted plants. She will give 1 potted plant from each of the 40 window ledges, so she will give away 40 potted plants. Therefore, she will remain with 98 - 40 = 58 potted plants.

Answer: \boxed{58}
